&lt;td&gt;Scheduling&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Focus&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Forest&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Avoiding phone&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="conclusion"&gt;Conclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This workflow evolved over years of trial and error. Your ideal setup will be different!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General principles&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate repetitive tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document everything (future you will thank present you)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems, not just habits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly review and refine your workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What tools and practices work for you? I&amp;rsquo;d love to hear! Reach out via email or
.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This post reflects my personal workflow as of 2024. Check back for updates as I continue refining!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>